    "pages": [
      {
        "source_page_id": "sangyo-medical-2025-general-a-b-physics-answers-p001",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "[1] 解答・解説",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "[1]",
                "value": "ア \\(\\frac{3a\\cos\\varphi+2d}{2}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "[1]",
                "value": "イ \\(\\frac{2}{3}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "[1]",
                "value": "ウ \\(\\frac{17}{9}a\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "[1]",
                "value": "エ \\(\\frac{5}{2}a\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "[1]",
                "value": "オ \\(3a\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "[1]",
                "value": "カ \\(\\frac{10}{3}a\\)"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "この大問の全体像",
            "text": "外側の円弧ADBと内側の半円筒GEで、力学的エネルギー保存と向心方向の運動方程式をそれぞれ立てる。軌道から離れない境界は垂直抗力が0になる条件で決まる。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "ア　外側の円弧から離れない最大高さ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "最高点Dからの角を \\(\\theta\\)、速さを \\(v\\)、円弧から受ける垂直抗力を \\(N\\) とする。まずSと円弧上の位置の間で力学的エネルギー保存則を使う。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a1-circular-arc-forces",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\begin{aligned}mgh&=\\frac12mv^2+mg(d+a\\cos\\theta)\\\\v^2&=2g(h-d-a\\cos\\theta)\\end{aligned}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "向心方向を円の中心向きに取り、運動方程式を立てる。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "m\\frac{v^2}{a}=mg\\cos\\theta-N",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "二式を組み合わせると、垂直抗力は次の形になる。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "N=\\left(3\\cos\\theta-\\frac{2h}{a}+\\frac{2d}{a}\\right)mg",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(0\\le\\theta\\le\\varphi\\) では円弧端の \\(\\theta=\\varphi\\) で \\(N\\) が最小になる。ここで \\(N\\ge0\\) とすればよい。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\left(3\\cos\\varphi-\\frac{2h}{a}+\\frac{2d}{a}\\right)mg\\ge0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "h\\le\\frac{3a\\cos\\varphi+2d}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "したがって、条件を満たす \\(h\\) の最大値は \\((3a\\cos\\varphi+2d)/2\\) である。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "sangyo-medical-2025-general-a-b-physics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "イ　頂点Dを越えられる条件",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "Dを越えるには \\(h>a+d\\) が必要で、同時にアの上限以下でなければならない。二つを両立させる。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a+d<h\\le\\frac{3a\\cos\\varphi+2d}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a+d<\\frac{3a\\cos\\varphi+2d}{2}\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad\\cos\\varphi>\\frac23",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "ウ　半円筒から離れる高さ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "最高点Eからの角を \\(\\theta'\\)、速さを \\(v'\\)、半円筒から受ける垂直抗力を \\(N'\\) とする。Sからこの位置までのエネルギー保存則を使う。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a1-hollow-forces",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\begin{aligned}mgh&=\\frac12mv'^2+mga(1+\\cos\\theta')\\\\v'^2&=2g(h-a-a\\cos\\theta')\\end{aligned}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "内側円運動なので、中心向きには \\(N'\\) と重力の成分が働く。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "m\\frac{v'^2}{a}=N'+mg\\cos\\theta'",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "N'=\\left(\\frac{2h}{a}-2-3\\cos\\theta'\\right)mg\\qquad\\cdots(1)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "軌道を離れる瞬間は \\(N'=0\\)。\\(h=7a/3\\) を(1)へ代入する。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\cos\\theta'=\\frac89",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a+a\\cos\\theta'=\\frac{17}{9}a",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "エ　Eへ達する最小高さ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "Eでは \\(\\theta'=0\\)。その位置で \\(N'\\ge0\\) となる境界を(1)から求める。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\left(\\frac{2h}{a}-5\\right)mg\\ge0\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad h\\ge\\frac52a",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "sangyo-medical-2025-general-a-b-physics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "オ・カ　全軌道を離れない高さの範囲",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "外側円弧では \\(a+d<h\\le(3a\\cos\\varphi+2d)/2\\)、半円筒では \\(h\\ge5a/2\\) が必要である。\\(d=2a,\\ \\cos\\varphi=8/9\\) を代入する。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "3a<h\\le\\frac{10}{3}a",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "この範囲は半円筒側の条件も満たすので、オは \\(3a\\)、カは \\(10a/3\\) となる。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "[2] 解答・解説",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "[2]",
                "value": "ア \\(C_V(c-b)\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "[2]",
                "value": "イ \\(\\frac{d-a}{c-b}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "[2]",
                "value": "ウ \\(C_p(b-a+d-c)\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "[2]",
                "value": "エ \\(\\frac{a-b}{d-c}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "[2]",
                "value": "オ \\(\\frac{C_V(d-a)}{C_p(c-b)}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "[2]",
                "value": "カ \\(0\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "[2]",
                "value": "キ \\(\\frac{b}{d}\\)"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "この大問の全体像",
            "text": "各PVサイクルで、定積なら \\(Q=C_V\\Delta T\\)、定圧なら \\(Q=C_p\\Delta T\\)、断熱なら \\(Q=0\\) を使う。1サイクルの内部エネルギー変化は0で、熱効率は正味仕事を吸収熱で割る。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "ア　サイクルIの定積受熱",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "B→Cは定積変化なので仕事は0。熱力学第一法則から、受け取る熱量は内部エネルギーの増加に等しい。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "Q_{BC}=C_V(c-b)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "イ　サイクルIの熱効率",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "A→BとC→Dは断熱変化である。気体が外部にする仕事をそれぞれ \\(W_{AB},W_{CD}\\) とし、各過程へ熱力学第一法則を使う。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\begin{aligned}W_{AB}&=-C_V(b-a)\\\\W_{CD}&=C_V(c-d)\\end{aligned}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\begin{aligned}e_I&=\\frac{W_{AB}+W_{CD}}{Q_{BC}}\\\\&=1-\\frac{d-a}{c-b}\\end{aligned}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "sangyo-medical-2025-general-a-b-physics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "ウ・エ　サイクルII",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "1サイクルで内部エネルギーは元に戻る。A→BとC→Dは定圧変化なので、二つの熱量の和が正味仕事になる。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "W_{II}=C_p(b-a+d-c)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "C→Dで吸収する熱量は \\(C_p(d-c)\\)。これで正味仕事を割る。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\begin{aligned}e_{II}&=\\frac{C_p(b-a+d-c)}{C_p(d-c)}\\\\&=1-\\frac{a-b}{d-c}\\end{aligned}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "オ　サイクルIII",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "定圧過程B→Cの吸収熱と、定積過程D→Aの放出熱を用いる。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\begin{aligned}e_{III}&=\\frac{C_p(c-b)+C_V(a-d)}{C_p(c-b)}\\\\&=1-\\frac{C_V(d-a)}{C_p(c-b)}\\end{aligned}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "カ・キ　サイクルIV",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "1サイクル後は元の状態へ戻るので、内部エネルギー変化は0。熱効率は吸収熱 \\(Q_{CD}\\) から放出熱 \\(Q_{AB}\\) を引いて割る。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "e_{IV}=\\frac{Q_{CD}-Q_{AB}}{Q_{CD}}=1-\\frac{b}{d}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "[3] 解答・解説",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(1)",
                "value": "\\(\\frac{\\lambda}{d}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2)",
                "value": "\\(\\pi\\,[\\mathrm{rad}]\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3)",
                "value": "\\(\\frac{\\lambda}{2d}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(4)",
                "value": "\\(\\frac{L\\lambda}{2d}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(5-1)",
                "value": "\\(\\frac{L\\lambda}{2nd}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(5-2)",
                "value": "\\(4.5\\times10^{-7}\\,\\mathrm{m}\\)"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "この大問の全体像",
            "text": "最初は通常の回折格子の明線条件を使う。透明平板を交互に入れた後は二群の光に位相差 \\(\\pi\\) が生じ、明線条件が半波長分ずれる。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1) 通常の1次明線",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "隣り合うスリットを通る光の光路差は \\(d\\sin\\theta_A\\)。\\(m_1\\) は1次明線である。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "d\\sin\\theta_A=\\lambda\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad\\sin\\theta_A=\\frac{\\lambda}{d}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2) 透明平板による位相差",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(m_1',m_1,m_2'\\) は明線・暗線・明線の順で等間隔に並ぶため、中央の \\(m_0\\) も暗線になる。二群の直進光は逆位相で、位相差は \\(\\pi\\) radである。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "sangyo-medical-2025-general-a-b-physics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3) 透明平板を入れた後の明線条件",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "二群の光は最初から位相差 \\(\\pi\\) を持つ。最寄りの明線 \\(m_1'\\) では、スリット後の光路差が半波長に相当する。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "d\\sin\\theta_B=\\left(0+\\frac12\\right)\\lambda",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sin\\theta_B=\\frac{\\lambda}{2d}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(4) スクリーン上の間隔",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(m_0\\) と \\(m_1'\\) の間隔を \\(x\\) とする。小角近似より \\(x/L=\\tan\\theta_B=\\sin\\theta_B\\)。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{x}{L}=\\frac{\\lambda}{2d}\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x=\\frac{L\\lambda}{2d}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(5-1) 屈折率nの物質で満たす",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "物質中では波長が \\(\\lambda/n\\) になる。(4)の式で \\(\\lambda\\) を \\(\\lambda/n\\) に置き換える。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x'=\\frac{L\\lambda}{2nd}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(5-2) 波長の数値計算",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(5-1)の式を \\(\\lambda\\) について解き、与えられた値を代入する。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\begin{aligned}\\lambda&=\\frac{2ndx'}{L}\\\\&=\\frac{2\\times1.5\\times2.0\\times10^{-5}\\times3.0\\times10^{-3}}{4.0\\times10^{-1}}\\\\&=4.5\\times10^{-7}\\,\\mathrm{m}\\end{aligned}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
